Package: chaosircd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: runit
Description: modular IRC server with reverse-DNS/proxy-scan auth helper
 chaosircd is a modular IRC daemon (loadable-module message handlers,
 channel modes and usermodes). It ships with servauth, a helper process
 the ircd talks to over a socketpair, which performs asynchronous
 reverse/forward DNS resolution, ident (RFC1413) auth checks, and
 open-proxy scanning (HTTP CONNECT, SOCKS4, SOCKS5, wingate, cisco) for
 connecting clients.
 .
 This package installs the ircd and servauth binaries, loadable
 modules, default configuration, and a runit service definition
 (etc/service/chaosircd) - link it into your runit scandir (typically
 /etc/service) to run it.
